      "versionNonce": 1890211573,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791126500290,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• MQA — 1 KV head (PaLM, Falcon-7B)\n• GQA — G KV heads; the default in\n  Llama 2-70B / 3, Mistral, Qwen\n• MLA — cache latent d_c + RoPE d_R\n  (DeepSeek-V2/V3, Kimi K2)\n• Cross-layer KV sharing\n  (CLA, YOCO) → attacks L\n• Hybrid SSM / linear-attention\n  layers (Jamba, Qwen3-Next)\n  → no KV in most layers\nRetrofit: GQA uptraining from MHA,\n  MHA→MLA conversion (TransMLA)\nCost: (re)training, quality tradeoff",
      "originalText": "• MQA — 1 KV head (PaLM, Falcon-7B)\n• GQA — G KV heads; the default in\n  Llama 2-70B / 3, Mistral, Qwen\n• MLA — cache latent d_c + RoPE d_R\n  (DeepSeek-V2/V3, Kimi K2)\n• Cross-layer KV sharing\n  (CLA, YOCO) → attacks L\n• Hybrid SSM / linear-attention\n  layers (Jamba, Qwen3-Next)\n  → no KV in most layers\nRetrofit: GQA uptraining from MHA,\n  MHA→MLA conversion (TransMLA)\nCost: (re)training, quality tradeoff",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "e8",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "a8"
