      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• FP8 KV (E4M3) — 2× vs FP16\n  vLLM kv_cache_dtype=fp8,\n  TensorRT-LLM, SGLang\n• INT4 / INT2 KV — KIVI\n  (per-channel K, per-token V),\n  KVQuant\n• NVFP4 KV on Blackwell\n• Keeps every token; small\n  accuracy hit; needs scales\nNo retraining. Multiplies with ①.",
      "originalText": "• FP8 KV (E4M3) — 2× vs FP16\n  vLLM kv_cache_dtype=fp8,\n  TensorRT-LLM, SGLang\n• INT4 / INT2 KV — KIVI\n  (per-channel K, per-token V),\n  KVQuant\n• NVFP4 KV on Blackwell\n• Keeps every token; small\n  accuracy hit; needs scales\nNo retraining. Multiplies with ①.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
