      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Trained in (architecture):\n• Sliding-window attention\n  (Mistral 7B; Gemma 2/3\n  local:global; gpt-oss\n  alternating layers)\n• Attention sinks + window\n  (StreamingLLM)\nPost-hoc eviction (lossy):\n• H2O, SnapKV, PyramidKV,\n  DuoAttention\n⚠ evicted tokens are gone —\n  run needle / long-context evals",
      "originalText": "Trained in (architecture):\n• Sliding-window attention\n  (Mistral 7B; Gemma 2/3\n  local:global; gpt-oss\n  alternating layers)\n• Attention sinks + window\n  (StreamingLLM)\nPost-hoc eviction (lossy):\n• H2O, SnapKV, PyramidKV,\n  DuoAttention\n⚠ evicted tokens are gone —\n  run needle / long-context evals",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "e20",
