      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791125844036,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• PagedAttention (vLLM): fixed\n  blocks + block table →\n  waste ≤ 1 block per request\n• Continuous batching: requests\n  join/leave every iteration\n• Offload / tiering GPU→CPU→SSD\n  (LMCache, Mooncake)\n• Disaggregated prefill/decode\n  ships KV between GPUs\n  (NVIDIA Dynamo, llm-d)\nSame bytes, better utilisation;\noffload trades VRAM for latency",
      "originalText": "• PagedAttention (vLLM): fixed\n  blocks + block table →\n  waste ≤ 1 block per request\n• Continuous batching: requests\n  join/leave every iteration\n• Offload / tiering GPU→CPU→SSD\n  (LMCache, Mooncake)\n• Disaggregated prefill/decode\n  ships KV between GPUs\n  (NVIDIA Dynamo, llm-d)\nSame bytes, better utilisation;\noffload trades VRAM for latency",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "e26",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "aQ"
