      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791125844036,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Prefix caching: vLLM APC\n  (hashed blocks), SGLang\n  RadixAttention (radix tree)\n• Provider prompt caching:\n  system prompt, RAG docs, tools\n• KV-aware routing: send the\n  request to the replica that\n  already holds its prefix\n• One physical copy shared by\n  many requests (copy-on-write)\nUnique tokens still cost full KV",
      "originalText": "• Prefix caching: vLLM APC\n  (hashed blocks), SGLang\n  RadixAttention (radix tree)\n• Provider prompt caching:\n  system prompt, RAG docs, tools\n• KV-aware routing: send the\n  request to the replica that\n  already holds its prefix\n• One physical copy shared by\n  many requests (copy-on-write)\nUnique tokens still cost full KV",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "e32",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
