      "updated": 1791125844036,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• FlashAttention-2/3: tiled,\n  fused, no T×T matrix in HBM\n• FlashDecoding: split KV along\n  T across SMs for 1-query decode\n• FlashInfer / FlashMLA: paged\n  and MLA-specific kernels\n• GQA-aware kernels load each\n  KV head once per Q group\nSize unchanged; TPOT improves\n(decode is memory-bound)",
      "originalText": "• FlashAttention-2/3: tiled,\n  fused, no T×T matrix in HBM\n• FlashDecoding: split KV along\n  T across SMs for 1-query decode\n• FlashInfer / FlashMLA: paged\n  and MLA-specific kernels\n• GQA-aware kernels load each\n  KV head once per Q group\nSize unchanged; TPOT improves\n(decode is memory-bound)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "e38",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "ac"
    },
