    },
    {
      "id": "e61",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 25,
      "y": 1231,
      "width": 748.828125,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1799361520,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 1445861557,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791126644727,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Technique         Term        Smaller?   Lossless?        Retrain?\nGQA / MQA         H_kv        4–32×      arch choice      yes / uptrain\nMLA               H_kv·d_h    ~14–57×    arch choice      yes / convert\nCLA / YOCO        L           ≥2×        arch choice      yes\nSWA / hybrid      T, L        large      arch choice      yes\nFP8 KV            bytes       2×         near-lossless    no\nINT4 / INT2 KV    bytes       4–8×       small loss       no\nH2O / SnapKV      T           large      lossy            no\nPagedAttention    waste       capacity↑  yes              no\nPrefix caching    recompute   shared     yes              no\nOffload / tiers   placement   GPU-side   yes, +latency    no\nFlash kernels     HBM reads   no         yes              no",
      "originalText": "Technique         Term        Smaller?   Lossless?        Retrain?\nGQA / MQA         H_kv        4–32×      arch choice      yes / uptrain\nMLA               H_kv·d_h    ~14–57×    arch choice      yes / convert\nCLA / YOCO        L           ≥2×        arch choice      yes\nSWA / hybrid      T, L        large      arch choice      yes\nFP8 KV            bytes       2×         near-lossless    no\nINT4 / INT2 KV    bytes       4–8×       small loss       no\nH2O / SnapKV      T           large      lossy            no\nPagedAttention    waste       capacity↑  yes              no\nPrefix caching    recompute   shared     yes              no\nOffload / tiers   placement   GPU-side   yes, +latency    no\nFlash kernels     HBM reads   no         yes              no",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "e60",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "ay"
    },
