      "index": "b00"
    },
    {
      "id": "e64",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1195,
      "y": 1231,
      "width": 814.5176391601562,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1685254564,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 1597660827,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791126641117,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Serving an existing model (L, H_kv, d_h are fixed):\n  ② FP8 KV  +  ④ paged + continuous batching  +  ⑤ prefix caching  +  ⑥ Flash kernels\n  then ④ offload if still short; ③ eviction last, only after long-context evals\n\nDesigning or training a model:\n  ① GQA-8 is the safe default; MLA when long context × concurrency dominates cost\n  ① + ③ local:global or SSM hybrids for 128K – 1M contexts\n\nThe levers multiply: size (①②) × tokens (③) × management (④⑤) × speed (⑥)\n\nYour model @ 100K: MHA 26.2 GB → GQA-8 6.55 GB → +FP8 3.28 GB\n  → MLA-style latent 1.84 GB → paged: ≤ 1 block wasted per request",
      "originalText": "Serving an existing model (L, H_kv, d_h are fixed):\n  ② FP8 KV  +  ④ paged + continuous batching  +  ⑤ prefix caching  +  ⑥ Flash kernels\n  then ④ offload if still short; ③ eviction last, only after long-context evals\n\nDesigning or training a model:\n  ① GQA-8 is the safe default; MLA when long context × concurrency dominates cost\n  ① + ③ local:global or SSM hybrids for 128K – 1M contexts\n\nThe levers multiply: size (①②) × tokens (③) × management (④⑤) × speed (⑥)\n\nYour model @ 100K: MHA 26.2 GB → GQA-8 6.55 GB → +FP8 3.28 GB\n  → MLA-style latent 1.84 GB → paged: ≤ 1 block wasted per request",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "e63",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b01"
    },
    {
      "id": "t2_1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 2900,
      "width": 868.0,
      "height": 35.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
