      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1132085851,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Same model throughout: Llama-3-8B shape (L = 32, H_Q = 32, H_kv = 8, d_h = 128) → 128 KiB/token in FP16, 512 MiB per 4k-token sequence.  Assume ~60 GiB of an 80 GB GPU is left for KV.",
      "originalText": "Same model throughout: Llama-3-8B shape (L = 32, H_Q = 32, H_kv = 8, d_h = 128) → 128 KiB/token in FP16, 512 MiB per 4k-token sequence.  Assume ~60 GiB of an 80 GB GPU is left for KV.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
