      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Same model, now at T = 32k tokens: full GQA cache = 128 KiB × 32768 = 4 GiB per sequence.  Trained-in methods are safe; post-hoc eviction is lossy.",
      "originalText": "Same model, now at T = 32k tokens: full GQA cache = 128 KiB × 32768 = 4 GiB per sequence.  Trained-in methods are safe; post-hoc eviction is lossy.",
