      "versionNonce": 85310962,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "16-token blocks = 2 MiB\nwaste ≤ 1 block / request",
      "originalText": "16-token blocks = 2 MiB\nwaste ≤ 1 block / request",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "t2_102",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "t2_104",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 458,
      "y": 4414,
      "width": 357.12,
      "height": 200.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1945739323,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1918365310,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "KV lives in fixed blocks (like OS\npages); a block table maps each\nrequest's logical → physical blocks.\nBlock = 16 tokens × 128 KiB = 2 MiB.\nAllocate on demand: waste < 4%.\n4k avg → 120 requests, not 60.\n\nBonus: copy-on-write sharing for\nparallel sampling / beam search.\nNow standard: vLLM, SGLang, TRT-LLM.",
      "originalText": "KV lives in fixed blocks (like OS\npages); a block table maps each\nrequest's logical → physical blocks.\nBlock = 16 tokens × 128 KiB = 2 MiB.\nAllocate on demand: waste < 4%.\n4k avg → 120 requests, not 60.\n\nBonus: copy-on-write sharing for\nparallel sampling / beam search.\nNow standard: vLLM, SGLang, TRT-LLM.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
