      "versionNonce": 1690518755,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4k shared tokens\n≈ 0.1 s + 512 MiB / request",
      "originalText": "4k shared tokens\n≈ 0.1 s + 512 MiB / request",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "t2_139",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "t2_141",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 36,
      "y": 5010,
      "width": 327.36,
      "height": 180.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1052214587,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 12352346,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Without reuse, 100 requests that\nshare a 4k system prompt:\n  100 × 0.1 s prefill = 10 GPU-s\n  100 × 512 MiB = 50 GiB of\n  identical KV\nWith reuse: compute once, store\nonce (512 MiB), share the blocks.\n\nWin: TTFT, GPU time and memory.",
      "originalText": "Without reuse, 100 requests that\nshare a 4k system prompt:\n  100 × 0.1 s prefill = 10 GPU-s\n  100 × 512 MiB = 50 GiB of\n  identical KV\nWith reuse: compute once, store\nonce (512 MiB), share the blocks.\n\nWin: TTFT, GPU time and memory.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
