      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Same idea, sold as a feature:\n  Anthropic: cache_control\n  breakpoints, short TTL\n  OpenAI / Gemini: automatic on\n  long repeated prefixes\nLower cost and TTFT on hits.\n\nPrompt layout matters: static\nparts first (system, tools,\ndocs), changing parts last.",
      "originalText": "Same idea, sold as a feature:\n  Anthropic: cache_control\n  breakpoints, short TTL\n  OpenAI / Gemini: automatic on\n  long repeated prefixes\nLower cost and TTFT on hits.\n\nPrompt layout matters: static\nparts first (system, tools,\ndocs), changing parts last.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
