      "versionNonce": 183639509,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "reuse RAG chunk KV at any\nposition · fix ~15% tokens",
      "originalText": "reuse RAG chunk KV at any\nposition · fix ~15% tokens",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "t2_174",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "t2_176",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2146,
      "y": 5010,
      "width": 307.52,
      "height": 200.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 60139918,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1172155701,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RAG docs appear in a different\norder each time, so prefix\ncaching misses them.\nCacheBlend reuses each chunk's\nprecomputed KV and recomputes a\nsmall set of tokens (~15%) to\nrestore cross-chunk attention.\n\nResearch-grade; LMCache\nintegrates it.",
      "originalText": "RAG docs appear in a different\norder each time, so prefix\ncaching misses them.\nCacheBlend reuses each chunk's\nprecomputed KV and recomputes a\nsmall set of tokens (~15%) to\nrestore cross-chunk attention.\n\nResearch-grade; LMCache\nintegrates it.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "t2_177",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 5344,
      "width": 711.76,
      "height": 35.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 864304324,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1420901973,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⑥ Read it faster — technique by technique",
      "originalText": "⑥ Read it faster — technique by technique",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "t2_178",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 5388,
      "width": 1886.04,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1682660363,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 547804892,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Same model on an H100 (3.35 TB/s HBM, ~990 TFLOP/s FP16).  Each decode step must read all weights (16 GB) and every cached K, V — bandwidth, not compute, sets the speed.",
      "originalText": "Same model on an H100 (3.35 TB/s HBM, ~990 TFLOP/s FP16).  Each decode step must read all weights (16 GB) and every cached K, V — bandwidth, not compute, sets the speed.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "t2_179",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 20,
