      "versionNonce": 526410671,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "batch 32 × 4k: 16 GiB KV\n+ 16 GB weights ≈ 10 ms/step",
      "originalText": "batch 32 × 4k: 16 GiB KV\n+ 16 GB weights ≈ 10 ms/step",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "t2_183",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "t2_185",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 36,
      "y": 5606,
      "width": 327.36,
      "height": 200.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2134655922,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 797305397,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Decode makes 1 token per request\nper step, so every byte read does\n~1–2 FLOPs. The H100 needs ~300\nFLOP/byte to be compute-bound.\nBatch 32 at 4k: KV (16 GiB) ≈\nweights (16 GB); at 32k KV is 8×\nthe weights.\n\nSo: read fewer bytes (①②③), or\nread them more cleverly (⑥).",
      "originalText": "Decode makes 1 token per request\nper step, so every byte read does\n~1–2 FLOPs. The H100 needs ~300\nFLOP/byte to be compute-bound.\nBatch 32 at 4k: KV (16 GiB) ≈\nweights (16 GB); at 32k KV is 8×\nthe weights.\n\nSo: read fewer bytes (①②③), or\nread them more cleverly (⑥).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
