      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GQA with H_kv = H_Q/4: load one\nKV head into SRAM, compute all 4\nquery heads that share it.\n→ KV bytes read ÷ 4,\n  FLOPs per byte × 4.\nFlashMLA attends directly over the\n576-wide MLA latent.\n\nKernels: FlashInfer, FA2/3,\nFlashMLA.",
      "originalText": "GQA with H_kv = H_Q/4: load one\nKV head into SRAM, compute all 4\nquery heads that share it.\n→ KV bytes read ÷ 4,\n  FLOPs per byte × 4.\nFlashMLA attends directly over the\n576-wide MLA latent.\n\nKernels: FlashInfer, FA2/3,\nFlashMLA.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
