      "locked": false,
      "text": "draft k tokens, verify in\none pass: 1 read → k tokens",
      "originalText": "draft k tokens, verify in\none pass: 1 read → k tokens",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "t2_218",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "t2_220",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2146,
      "y": 5606,
      "width": 327.36,
      "height": 180.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 248910157,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1996186012,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A small draft model (or MTP /\nEAGLE heads) proposes k tokens;\nthe big model checks all k in one\nforward pass.\nWeights and KV are read once per\npass, so 2–3 accepted tokens per\npass ≈ 2–3× faster decode.\n\nOutput is identical (lossless).",
      "originalText": "A small draft model (or MTP /\nEAGLE heads) proposes k tokens;\nthe big model checks all k in one\nforward pass.\nWeights and KV are read once per\npass, so 2–3 accepted tokens per\npass ≈ 2–3× faster decode.\n\nOutput is identical (lossless).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "t2_221",
      "type": "text",
