      "seed": 1653751936,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2133091879,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "H_kv = H_Q = 32\nEvery query head has its own K, V.\nper token, per layer:\n  2 × 32 × 128 × 2 B = 16 KiB\n× 32 layers = 512 KiB / token\n× 4096 tokens = 2 GiB / sequence\n\nBaseline: best quality, biggest\ncache. Decode is memory-bound, so\nevery step re-reads all 2 GiB.\nUsed by: GPT-3, Llama 1 / 2-7B",
      "originalText": "H_kv = H_Q = 32\nEvery query head has its own K, V.\nper token, per layer:\n  2 × 32 × 128 × 2 B = 16 KiB\n× 32 layers = 512 KiB / token\n× 4096 tokens = 2 GiB / sequence\n\nBaseline: best quality, biggest\ncache. Decode is memory-bound, so\nevery step re-reads all 2 GiB.\nUsed by: GPT-3, Llama 1 / 2-7B",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
