    {
      "id": "t1_58",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 458,
      "y": 2050,
      "width": 337.28,
      "height": 280.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 953776408,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1966610355,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "H_kv = H_Q / 4 = 8   (group g = 4)\n4 query heads share one K,V head.\nper token, per layer:\n  2 × 8 × 128 × 2 B = 4 KiB\n× 32 layers = 128 KiB / token\n× 4096 tokens = 512 MiB  → 4× less\n\nRule: cache ∝ H_kv, so\n  H_kv = H_Q / g  →  cache ÷ g\nK,V are expanded to 32 heads at\ncompute time (repeat_interleave);\nonly the 8 are stored.\nQuality ≈ MHA. Llama 3 8B is\nexactly this: 32 Q / 8 KV heads.",
      "originalText": "H_kv = H_Q / 4 = 8   (group g = 4)\n4 query heads share one K,V head.\nper token, per layer:\n  2 × 8 × 128 × 2 B = 4 KiB\n× 32 layers = 128 KiB / token\n× 4096 tokens = 512 MiB  → 4× less\n\nRule: cache ∝ H_kv, so\n  H_kv = H_Q / g  →  cache ÷ g\nK,V are expanded to 32 heads at\ncompute time (repeat_interleave);\nonly the 8 are stored.\nQuality ≈ MHA. Llama 3 8B is\nexactly this: 32 Q / 8 KV heads.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
