    {
      "id": "t1_82",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 2050,
      "width": 347.2,
      "height": 260.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 948851796,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2081075449,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "H_kv = 1   (g = H_Q = 32)\nAll query heads share ONE K,V head.\nper token, per layer:\n  2 × 1 × 128 × 2 B = 512 B\n× 32 layers = 16 KiB / token\n× 4096 tokens = 64 MiB  → 32× less\n\nSmallest head-based cache.\nCost: quality drop, less stable\ntraining; under tensor parallel\nthe one KV head is replicated on\nevery GPU, so savings shrink.\nUsed by: PaLM, Falcon-7B, StarCoder",
      "originalText": "H_kv = 1   (g = H_Q = 32)\nAll query heads share ONE K,V head.\nper token, per layer:\n  2 × 1 × 128 × 2 B = 512 B\n× 32 layers = 16 KiB / token\n× 4096 tokens = 64 MiB  → 32× less\n\nSmallest head-based cache.\nCost: quality drop, less stable\ntraining; under tensor parallel\nthe one KV head is replicated on\nevery GPU, so savings shrink.\nUsed by: PaLM, Falcon-7B, StarCoder",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
