      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "cached: one latent per token",
      "originalText": "cached: one latent per token",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "t1_107",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1302,
      "y": 2050,
      "width": 367.04,
      "height": 280.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 111839364,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 846894795,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Cache a compressed latent, not heads:\nc_KV (d_c = 512) + RoPE key k_R\n(d_R = 64), shared by all heads.\nper token, per layer:\n  (512 + 64) × 2 B = 1152 B\n× 32 layers = 36 KiB / token\n× 4096 tokens = 144 MiB → ~14× less\n(no ×2: K and V both come from c_KV)\n\nPer-head K, V are up-projected\nfrom c_KV; at inference W_UK, W_UV\nare absorbed into W_Q and W_O.\nMatches MHA quality (DeepSeek-V2).\nUsed by: DeepSeek-V2/V3, Kimi K2",
      "originalText": "Cache a compressed latent, not heads:\nc_KV (d_c = 512) + RoPE key k_R\n(d_R = 64), shared by all heads.\nper token, per layer:\n  (512 + 64) × 2 B = 1152 B\n× 32 layers = 36 KiB / token\n× 4096 tokens = 144 MiB → ~14× less\n(no ×2: K and V both come from c_KV)\n\nPer-head K, V are up-projected\nfrom c_KV; at inference W_UK, W_UV\nare absorbed into W_Q and W_O.\nMatches MHA quality (DeepSeek-V2).\nUsed by: DeepSeek-V2/V3, Kimi K2",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
