      "seed": 530839162,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1431205085,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "cached: 2 KV sets for 4 layers",
      "originalText": "cached: 2 KV sets for 4 layers",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "t1_130",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1724,
      "y": 2050,
      "width": 357.12,
      "height": 280.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1448097106,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 519964143,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Adjacent layers share one KV cache.\nCLA-2 on top of GQA (H_kv = 8):\nKV made in layer 2i is reused by\nlayer 2i+1 → L_kv = 32 / 2 = 16\n  2 × 8 × 128 × 2 B = 4 KiB\n× 16 KV layers = 64 KiB / token\n× 4096 tokens = 256 MiB\n→ 2× over GQA, 8× over MHA\n\nAttacks L, so it stacks with GQA,\nMLA and KV quantisation.\nYOCO: one global cache built mid-\nnetwork, reused by all upper layers.\nMust be trained in from the start.",
      "originalText": "Adjacent layers share one KV cache.\nCLA-2 on top of GQA (H_kv = 8):\nKV made in layer 2i is reused by\nlayer 2i+1 → L_kv = 32 / 2 = 16\n  2 × 8 × 128 × 2 B = 4 KiB\n× 16 KV layers = 64 KiB / token\n× 4096 tokens = 256 MiB\n→ 2× over GQA, 8× over MHA\n\nAttacks L, so it stacks with GQA,\nMLA and KV quantisation.\nYOCO: one global cache built mid-\nnetwork, reused by all upper layers.\nMust be trained in from the start.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
