      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "t1_142",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2146,
      "y": 2050,
      "width": 347.2,
      "height": 300.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 613157280,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1935577284,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Convert a trained GQA model to MLA\nwithout pretraining again.\nGQA with H_kv = H_Q/4 copies each\nKV head 4×; that copy is a low-rank\nmap, so GQA is MLA with a fixed\nlatent. Steps:\n 1. factor W_K, W_V → down-proj\n    (latent) + up-proj\n 2. split off a small RoPE part\n 3. shrink the latent (PCA / SVD)\n 4. short fine-tune to recover\nGain: smaller cache than the GQA\noriginal + MLA kernels (FlashMLA).\nCousin: GQA uptraining (MHA → GQA,\nmean-pool KV heads, ~5% compute).",
      "originalText": "Convert a trained GQA model to MLA\nwithout pretraining again.\nGQA with H_kv = H_Q/4 copies each\nKV head 4×; that copy is a low-rank\nmap, so GQA is MLA with a fixed\nlatent. Steps:\n 1. factor W_K, W_V → down-proj\n    (latent) + up-proj\n 2. split off a small RoPE part\n 3. shrink the latent (PCA / SVD)\n 4. short fine-tune to recover\nGain: smaller cache than the GQA\noriginal + MLA kernels (FlashMLA).\nCousin: GQA uptraining (MHA → GQA,\nmean-pool KV heads, ~5% compute).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "t1_143",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 2540,
      "width": 1011.84,
      "height": 30.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
